        <body>
            <div xml:id="d307">

                <pb facs="1089" n="939" sameAs="frus:frus1907p2/pg939"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 4108/4–8.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to Minister
                        Squiers.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-04-12"><hi rendition="#italic">April 12,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 35.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have to acknowledge the receipt of your
                    No. 66, of the 8th ultimo, in regard to the consular jurisdiction over the
                    estates of citizens of the United States dying in the Republic of Panama.</p>
                <p>In reply I inclose for your information copy of the department’s instruction of
                    the 10th instant to the consul-general at Panama.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Bacon.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d307-a1.xml" xpointer="d307-a1"/>
            </div>
